#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:125
msgid "show the previous, play/pause and next row"
msgstr "mostrar la fila anterior, reproducir/pausa y siguiente"

#: spectrum/package/contents/ui/configPlayer.qml:129
msgid ""
"With no player on the bus the centre of the ring stays empty.\n"
"The controls take the mouse even while the rest passes clicks through."
msgstr ""
"Sin reproductor en el bus el centro del anillo queda vacío.\n"
"Los controles toman el ratón aunque el resto deje pasar los clics."

